.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.venv/
__pycache__/
node_modules/

# Projects using AEF keep their own .ai/ layer. It never belongs in this repo —
# a real project's plan, tasks and locks are that project's business, and a
# stray copy here would be someone else's private state published by accident.
.ai/

# ...with one deliberate exception: the example project's state IS the demo.
# Without it, `--root docs/example dashboard` renders an empty plan on every
# fresh clone, and the README's screenshots describe files nobody received.
# Caught by noticing the files were not staged, not by a user reporting it.
!docs/example/.ai/
!docs/example/.ai/**
